<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Azure Marketplace Private Offer — Process Overview</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f6f7fb; --card: #fff; --ink: #1a2233; --muted: #5b6577; --line: #d9dee9;
    --p1: #2563eb; --p2: #7c3aed; --p3: #0d9488;
    --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(16,24,40,.06), 0 4px 12px rgba(16,24,40,.08);
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Inter, Roboto, sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); padding: 48px 24px 72px; line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; }
  header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  header h1 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
  header p { color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; font-size: 14px; }

  .phase {
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow); padding: 24px;
  }
  .p1 { border-top: 4px solid var(--p1); }
  .p2 { border-top: 4px solid var(--p2); }
  .p3 { border-top: 4px solid var(--p3); }
  .phase h2 { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .phase .sub { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .ph-tag { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .p1 .ph-tag { color: var(--p1); } .p2 .ph-tag { color: var(--p2); } .p3 .ph-tag { color: var(--p3); }

  .row { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 0; }
  .row + .row { border-top: 1px solid #eef1f6; }
  .num {
    width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px;
    color: #fff; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .p1 .num { background: var(--p1); } .p2 .num { background: var(--p2); } .p3 .num { background: var(--p3); }
  .row .txt { flex: 1; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
  .row .txt small { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 400; margin-top: 2px; }
  .who {
    flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 3px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #fafbfe; border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 10px;
    max-width: 160px; text-align: center;
  }
  .note {
    margin: 6px 0 6px 36px; font-size: 12px; color: #92400e;
    background: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #fde68a; border-radius: 7px; padding: 4px 10px;
  }
  .result { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 13px; border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px 13px; }
  .p1 .result { background: #eff4ff; }
  .p2 .result { background: #f6f2ff; }
  .done { background: #ecfdf5; border: 1px solid #a7f3d0; color: #065f46; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; }

  .connector {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;
    color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; padding: 12px 0;
  }
  .connector svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; color: #98a2b3; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <header>
    <h1>Azure Marketplace Private Offer</h1>
    <p>Three phases, from first contact to signed in — full details in the per-phase guides</p>
  </header>

  <section class="phase p1">
    <span class="ph-tag">Phase 1</span>
    <h2>Share Two IDs With Normain</h2>
    <p class="sub">Normain needs two identifiers to create your offer. Both are found in the Azure Portal and take about a minute to look up.</p>
    <div class="row"><span class="num">1</span><span class="txt">Find your Billing Account ID <small>Open Cost Management + Billing → Settings → Properties and copy the Billing account ID.</small></span><span class="who">You</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span class="num">2</span><span class="txt">Find your Tenant ID <small>Open Microsoft Entra ID — the Tenant ID is on the Overview page.</small></span><span class="who">You</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span class="num">3</span><span class="txt">Send both values to your Normain contact <small>That's all — Normain takes it from there.</small></span><span class="who">You</span></div>
    <div class="result">📨 Normain creates the private offer and sends you the link when it is ready.</div>
  </section>

  <div class="connector">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 4v16m0 0l-6-6m6 6l6-6"/></svg>
    while you wait
  </div>

  <section class="phase p2">
    <span class="ph-tag">Phase 2</span>
    <h2>Line Up the Right People</h2>
    <p class="sub">Each step in Phase 3 requires specific permissions — find out who holds them before the offer arrives. If you own your Azure tenant, it is likely all you.</p>
    <div class="row"><span class="num">1</span><span class="txt">Confirm a usable Azure subscription exists <small>In the Azure Portal under Subscriptions: status must be Active, with a valid payment method. MSDN, Visual Studio, free trial and sponsorship subscriptions cannot be used. Missing? Create one via Subscriptions → + Add.</small></span><span class="who">Prerequisite</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span class="num">2</span><span class="txt">Find who can accept the offer <small>Requires billing administrator permissions — check who is listed under Cost Management + Billing → Access control (IAM).</small></span><span class="who">Billing administrator</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span class="num">3</span><span class="txt">Find who can complete the purchase <small>Requires the Owner or Contributor role on the subscription from step 1 — check that subscription's Access control (IAM).</small></span><span class="who">Subscription Owner or Contributor</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span class="num">4</span><span class="txt">Find who can approve app sign-in <small>Only needed if your organization requires administrator approval for new apps — check Microsoft Entra ID → Roles and administrators.</small></span><span class="who">Global Administrator</span></div>
    <div class="result">One person can hold all of these roles — common in smaller organizations.</div>
  </section>

  <div class="connector">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 4v16m0 0l-6-6m6 6l6-6"/></svg>
    the offer link arrives
  </div>

  <section class="phase p3">
    <span class="ph-tag">Phase 3</span>
    <h2>Accept → Purchase → Activate → Sign In</h2>
    <p class="sub">Four steps, strictly in this order.</p>
    <div class="row"><span class="num">1</span><span class="txt">Accept the private offer <small>Open the link from Normain, review what is included, the pricing and the dates, then click Accept private offer.</small></span><span class="who">Billing administrator</span></div>
    <div class="note">⏱ The Purchase button unlocks 15–60 minutes after accepting — refresh the page to check.</div>
    <div class="row"><span class="num">2</span><span class="txt">Complete the purchase <small>Select the Azure subscription and resource group, name the purchase (just a label for your reference), set auto-renew to off, then click Review + subscribe → Subscribe.</small></span><span class="who">Subscription Owner or Contributor</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span class="num">3</span><span class="txt">Activate the subscription <small>Azure redirects you to the Normain website — follow the instructions there to confirm and activate.</small></span><span class="who">You</span></div>
    <div class="note">⚠️ The purchase is not complete until you have activated it on the Normain website.</div>
    <div class="row"><span class="num">4</span><span class="txt">Sign in to the application <small>Go to &lt;your-instance&gt;.normain.com and sign in with your Microsoft work email. First sign-in only: approve the app yourself by clicking Accept, or click Request approval so your IT department can approve it.</small></span><span class="who">You</span></div>
    <div class="result done">✓ Signed in — setup complete</div>
  </section>
</div>
</body>
</html>
